          },
          {
            "word": "extreme",
            "pos": "n./adj.",
            "meaning": "极端"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Last year a journalist had been instructed by a well-known magazine to write an article on the president's palace in a new African republic.",
      "translation": "去年，一位记者受一家著名杂志的委托，要写一篇关于非洲某新共和国总统府的文章。",
      "startTime": 25.01,
      "endTime": 35.08,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "journalist",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "记者"
          },
          {
            "word": "instruct",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "指示，指导"
